      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PROCESS DRIVEN (6) comes off a moderate effort last start, finishing fourth at this track over 410m behind Oza Audacity (23.95). Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has ability and can bounce back. TEXAS TOAST (1) missed the frame last time when fifth (24.83) at Bendigo but prior to that had two placings in a row. Should be about the money. MR MARSHALL (5) turned in a plain run last time when fifth at this track over 410m behind Sinister Six (24.17) in a Maiden H. A big run wouldn't surprise. ZIPPING LUMINA (7) is a newcomer from the Matthew Lanigan kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Profiles well so pay to keep very safe.",
